{"id":"1e6602d1acf4aceb","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-subtraction-function.md","title":"Subtraction Function (Truncated)","display":"df-subtraction-function — Subtraction Function (Truncated)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-subtraction-function","aliases":["90-df-subtraction-function","90-df-sub"],"display":"df-subtraction-function — Subtraction Function (Truncated)","depends_on":["[[90-df-primrec-operator]]","[[90-df-composition-operator]]","[[90-df-projection-function]]","[[90-df-zero-function]]","[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-subtraction-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-subtraction-function</span><span>90-df-sub</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subtraction-function — Subtraction Function (Truncated)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac2460aba5c368e5\" href=\"?note=ac2460aba5c368e5\" title=\"90-df-primrec-operator\">90-df-primrec-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d499aedd34b7bfd\" href=\"?note=4d499aedd34b7bfd\" title=\"90-df-projection-function\">90-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-subtraction-function-—-Subtraction-Function-(Truncated)-$\\mathrm{sub}$\">df-subtraction-function — Subtraction Function (Truncated) <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{sub}\">\\(\\mathrm{sub}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 保持 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f760cc852de5c08\" href=\"?note=9f760cc852de5c08\" title=\"90-df-zero-function\">90-df-zero-function</a> 的一元零函数接口；复合、投影、末参数原始递归分别见元数据中的文件。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(r:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是下式按顺序引入的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\mathrm{PR}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\mathrm{PR}_2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a>；构造不调用 min 或 max。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nr&amp;:=\\operatorname{PrimRec}(Z,\\pi_2^3),\\qquad r(a,0)=0,\\quad r(a,n+1)=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Comp}(r,Z,\\pi_1^1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}(0)&amp;=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{pred}(n+1)=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}&amp;:=\\operatorname{PrimRec}\\bigl(\\pi_1^1,\n\\operatorname{Comp}(\\operatorname{pred},\\pi_3^3)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,0)&amp;=x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y+1)=\\operatorname{pred}(\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)=0&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ x\\le y,\\\\\ny\\le x&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{sub}(x,y)+y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&amp;\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\qquad r,\\operatorname{sub}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nr&amp;:=\\operatorname{PrimRec}(Z,\\pi_2^3),\\qquad r(a,0)=0,\\quad r(a,n+1)=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Comp}(r,Z,\\pi_1^1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}(0)&amp;=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{pred}(n+1)=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}&amp;:=\\operatorname{PrimRec}\\bigl(\\pi_1^1,\n\\operatorname{Comp}(\\operatorname{pred},\\pi_3^3)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,0)&amp;=x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y+1)=\\operatorname{pred}(\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)=0&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ x\\le y,\\\\\ny\\le x&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{sub}(x,y)+y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&amp;\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\qquad r,\\operatorname{sub}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原式以一元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 作为一元前驱函数所需的零元递归初值，元数不匹配。先用一元基函数生成二元辅助函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>，再固定虚位参数即可修复，不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>、原始递归基底、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}\">\\(\\operatorname{pred}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{sub}\\)</span> 的接口与值。末行性质由对递归参数归纳得到；原始递归与复合的闭包给出所列原始递归性，因此本构造不依赖 min 或 max。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-subtraction-function-—-Subtraction-Function-(Truncated)-$\\mathrm{sub}$","text":"df-subtraction-function — Subtraction Function (Truncated) $\\mathrm{sub}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-primrec-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ac2460aba5c368e5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primrec-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"1fd3a0e014d33285","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"4d499aedd34b7bfd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"9f760cc852de5c08","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"9f760cc852de5c08","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z$ 保持 [[90-df-zero-function]] 的一元零函数接口；复合、投影、末参数原始递归分别见元数据中的文件。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N$；$r:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$、$\\operatorname{pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$、$\\operatorname{sub}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 是下式按顺序引入的函数。$\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]]；构造不调用 min 或 max。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{sub}","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"a,n,x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"r:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pred}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\mathrm{PR}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nr&:=\\operatorname{PrimRec}(Z,\\pi_2^3),\\qquad r(a,0)=0,\\quad r(a,n+1)=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&:=\\operatorname{Comp}(r,Z,\\pi_1^1),\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}(0)&=0,\\qquad\\operatorname{pred}(n+1)=n,\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}&:=\\operatorname{PrimRec}\\bigl(\\pi_1^1,\n\\operatorname{Comp}(\\operatorname{pred},\\pi_3^3)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,0)&=x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y+1)=\\operatorname{pred}(\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sub}(x,y)=0&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ x\\le y,\\\\\ny\\le x&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{sub}(x,y)+y=x,\\\\\n\\operatorname{pred}&\\in\\mathrm{PR}_1,\\qquad r,\\operatorname{sub}\\in\\mathrm{PR}_2.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sub}","display":false}],"bytes":2052,"backlinks":[{"id":"220648f3ca864e2c","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-subtraction-function]] — 截断减法"},{"id":"b13ec70aec8d64a6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{sub} : \\mathbb{N}^2 \\to \\mathbb{N}$ (截断减法, see [[90-df-subtraction-function]])"},{"id":"3953b8fffc6e6551","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pred}$ 取 [[90-df-subtraction-function]]，用于半无限纸带的左端边界。"},{"id":"4a2564848c03103c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pred}$ 取 [[90-df-subtraction-function]]。"},{"id":"01ab533da9c8c517","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[90-df-subtraction-function]]，自然数集合的 $\\min$ 取 [[90-df-min-function]]；$\\ell$ 的候选集由纸带有限支撑保证非空，$U$ 的有效分支显式加入长度界作为候选。"},{"id":"5868c0a982292a6a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[90-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]]。$\\mathrm{add}$ 取 [[90-df-addition-function]] 的自然数加法。"},{"id":"4908d8a7f9b09936","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{sub}$ 取 [[90-df-subtraction-function]] 的二元截断减法，$\\mathrm{PR}_2$ 取 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]]。"},{"id":"88d284a5e496e4ef","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-subtraction-function]] — 截断减法"},{"id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pred}$ 取 [[90-df-subtraction-function]]，用于定义证书表后的行数。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-subtraction-function]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.m